      <Text tone="secondary" role="status">{done ?? "Choose an action from the menu."}</Text>
    </VStack>
  );
}

/** A menu whose trigger says nothing about what it does. */
```

**Don't:** “More” on its own says nothing to someone moving through a list of rows, and the delete sits between routine commands.

